---
import { UserIcon } from "./animate-ui/UserIcon.tsx";
import { ArrowLeftIcon } from "./animate-ui/ArrowLeftIcon.tsx";
---

<div
  class="blog-card relative w-full h-full rounded-lg border-2 border-[#DCDCDC] bg-[#F7F7F6]/60 px-4 py-3 text-base font-medium"
>
  <div class="flex w-full items-center justify-between">
    <p class="flex items-center gap-1 text-xs leading-tight">
      <UserIcon client:load className="mb-0.2" /><span class="font-semibold"
        >about me</span
      >
    </p>
  </div>
  <div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-4 mt-2">
    <p class="text-sm font-medium">
      hey! i'm rob, a student from germany who just likes building stuff! this
      site is where i share the things i build, the things i learn and the
      things that i found interesting along the way!
    </p>
    <p class="text-sm font-medium">
      other than that, some of my other hobbies are listening to music, working
      out, going for a jog or watching series / anime.
    </p>
    <p class="text-sm font-medium">
      i'm still figuring things out, but i enjoy the process of turning small
      ideas into real projects and would love to have this as my career in the
      future!
    </p>
    <p class="text-sm font-medium">
      If you want to talk to me, the best way to do so is to send me a mail. You
      can find my address on the contact page! Otherwise, if you're a member of
      Hack Club, feel free to send me a DM on Slack!
    </p>
    <a title="Heatmap stats through hackatime">
      <img
        alt="Activity Heatmap from Hackatime"
        src="https://heatmap.shymike.dev?id=816&timezone=Europe%2FBerlin&labels=true&theme=light&rounding=30"
        class="w-full rounded-lg grayscale"
      />
    </a>
  </div>
</div>
